OL,3,A'Pimping website' inquiry finds human
OL,4,Atrafficking 'hidden in plain sight'
OL,5,Aonline
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn investigation into "pimping
OL,8,Fwebsites" has found that human
OL,9,Ftrafficking is a "catastrophic" problem
OL,10,Fthat is being "hidden in plain sight
OL,11,Fonline".
OL,13,FThe Stormont inquiry was prompted by
OL,14,Fgrowing concerns about the exploitation
OL,15,Fof trafficked and vulnerable women on
OL,16,Fonline platforms.
OL,18,FThe subsequent report found women who
OL,19,Fwere forced into prostitution,
OL,20,Fadvertised online, drugged before
OL,21,F"appointments" and moved through cities
OL,22,Fone day at a time.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
